      "type": "reassess",
      "args": {},
      "justification": "AHA ACLS guideline for asystole/PEA mandates evaluation of reversible causes (H's and T's: hypovolemia, hypoxia, hydrogen ion, hypo/hyperkalemia, hypothermia, tension pneumothorax, tamponade, toxins, thrombosis). This is a required action per the guideline and must be completed promptly."
    },
    {
